    "source_url": "https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/UV-A"
  },
  {
    "english": "UV-B",
    "traditional_chinese": "B 波段紫外線",
    "definition_cht": "波長約 280 至 315 奈米的紫外線波段，對生物與光化學作用較為顯著，且受臭氧層影響明顯。",
    "source_url": "https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/UV-B"
